"Nala is a stray: no one summoned her. She fell through a thin place torn open over Earth."
"The tear was a first trial reach of Eleva's pantheon toward Earth's people; it closed at once."
"Serena felt the tear, caught the falling soul, and steered it far from Sun City and Randall."
"Serena's touch of Change remade Alan's falling body; the woman Nala is what Change made of him."
"Serena let go blind; she does not know where Nala landed and is too spent to search."
"No summoning circle chose what to keep, so what touched her skin fell with her: shirt and tights."
"The system reads Serena's thread in Nala as her unique trait and can show it only as ???."
"A god who appraised Nala closely would taste Serena's Change in her, and want to know why."
"Unset is the crossing's mark: her pattern, remade in the fall, has not yet hardened."
"If ever appraised, Nala's growth stat range reads F to S."
"Nala's ??? attribute would become Faith if a god made her a Champion."
"No god's ledger holds Nala; the gods of Eleva do not know a stray reached Firrelia."
